    "updated_at": "2019-09-16T01:58:31Z",
    "body": "My guess is that Linux mint is using some sort of magic in /etc/bashrc (or some similar config file) to provide this functionality, and we're accidentally clobbering it. This definitely is not native bash functionality...but we also make an effort to avoid breaking existing functionality so this is also definitely a bug.\r\n\r\nTracking down the root cause of this bug might prove tricky though...",
