    "created_at": "2019-12-09T04:01:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-09T04:01:55Z",
    "body": "Requires sending the OSC new title control sequence, setting `PROMPT_COMMAND` like below\r\n```\r\n$ echo $PROMPT_COMMAND\r\nstarship_precmd;echo -ne \"\\033]0;\\007\"\r\n```\r\nTitles get set and reset. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
