    "created_at": "2020-01-04T06:20:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-04T06:20:17Z",
    "body": "As an example for bash, I am handling this via a custom [set title function](https://github.com/r4um/dotfiles/blob/master/bash/zz_prompt#L40-L46) added to [PROMPT_COMMAND](https://github.com/r4um/dotfiles/blob/master/bash/zz_prompt#L54) after starship initialization.\r\n\r\nSince this is more of a terminal thing than shell's, it doesn't make a strong case to add this functionality to starship, happy to file a PR with a `terminal_title` config otherwise.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
